<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Efesu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa ko Obulus da Ase ke Efesu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ase ke Efesu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efs</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa ko Obulus da</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ase ke Efesu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Enena mani bwa abo hin Obulus, ni osho Owuso tu ko yun wo oyikoko ko Okristi Oyesu ni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Gebe kase ko Owuso ni be Efesu ni, awa ni gbo okwokwoshi ipu ko Okristi Oyesu ni:<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Owuso Ada kaha kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi na dala oneshi kpo omene.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otunehe ko Omaku ipu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Ahan shotunehe do Owuso Ada ka Adole kaha Oyesu Okristi! Koni ipu ko odudu ka kpo Okristi osaha aboneshi ko omaku bwole ki iso. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Ome ana yese, Owuso kwobonu shaha wakakanu bwebe ko dudu kaha kpo Okristi, shini ahan wase sere ni gbepwo ebe nu lo ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Ikweyi ki imu nu <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Owuso kwobonu gbo ko yaha wayi nu bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi, oza ni shotu ko yoya ni oma. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Ahan sho Owuso iye ikweyi koneshi ki igyashi nu, ikweyi ke eshi yeye ni odaha ipu ko Oyi nu moshi ni! <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Bwebe ko oyi ko Okristi pini ngmaha la, oyo ozalabi kaha gbaha. Eshi ko Owuso shoshi kotata <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />ni odaha nwashika ni!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Ipu ko oziyi kpo ogyogye nu <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Owuso yo oza ni okwobonu gbo ipu kotu nu ni, kweyi oya aha gyo oza ni ogbo teba ni bwebe ko Okristi. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Ozani Owuso gbo mani wa gya, owoni ishini gye, oyawa kpo ojoji ni oya ni kpiri ya tukpa, ojoji ni biso kpo oni bese kweyi ya yo Okristi ya kpuwogu.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ojoji kpiri gbodagye byoni Owuso gbo kweyi ogbimu; Owuso shaha shan wase nu ipu ko dudu kpo Okristi ikweyi ko mani, oza ni okwobonu yigbo bwikyikyo. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Mani oni ahan wikyikyo ko yiyitagye ipu ko Okristi, ahan shi igyashi ko Owuso iye!<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Ala ki wase ko Owuso ishini ala pwela ko okwokwoshi, Oshu Neshi ni wa ngmala ni. Ala kyogwu kpo Okristi, kweyi Owuso gwoyi nu ikpiye kala ni sayi mo ala wakaka nu bwebe ko Omaku ko Owuso ni oshokoyi dala ni. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Omaku sayi mo aha ba nyoza ni Owuso shokoyi dase nu ni, kweyi omani yaha gye mo Owuso ya ngmase ni wa akakanu. Ahan shi igyashi nu iye!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inarigwu ko Obulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Ikweyi koni, bwishi ni npwela kotuse kala ipu ka Adole Oyesu kpi imu ni ala gbo dase ko Owuso ni, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />nsho Owuso ko shotunehe danu bita ikweyi kala lo. Nyya rela kala ipu kinarigwu hin, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />kweyi nyya bo Owuso ka Adole kaha Oyesu Okristi, Ada ki igyashi, shona dala Omaku nu ni ya yala ba ziyi kweyi na sayi Owuso dala shini ala gyo neneshi. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Nyya tinarigwu do Owuso na gwotu kala shini ala mo yoyu nu, shini ala gyotuse ni oyala ogwu ni, shini ala gya aboneshi nyakwu ni oshokoyi da ase nu ni, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />shini ala gyo oshu nu kotata ni ya yoko ipu ka aha ni kyogwu ni. Oshu ni ya yoko ipu ka aha mani oye kponu kpo oshu ko Owuso. <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />Oshu mani pini Owuso yoko kpa anu kweyi sho Okristi iyi bwikwu kweyi yo yagye abore nu ole ki iso la. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Okristi woteyi ka awoteyi kpa awine ko oshu kpo oshu kpa awadole kpiri ipu ki iso; Owuso da anu iye ni yohobu ki iye wonyonya ipu kese mani kpe ese ni ya wa ni. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Owuso yojoji kpiri yi sheye kikpo ko Okristi kweyi yo wa adole kojoji kpiri kawo ko Owuso. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Oda ko Owuso wikpiye ko Okristi, ni wo kpiri-kpiri nu kweyi yojoji gyogya ebebenya ni.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Bwi Ikwu Wo Olayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Ipu ki ishi ni shigbo ni ala gekwu ipu ko omaku ikweyi koni ala ba geyagye lo kweyi ba yozalabi ni. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Ishi oni ala ba gboso owe bibi kese; ba geyagye do omaku bibi ni wo oteyi ko oshu ko obula ko owu ni, omaku ni ya yoko ipu kawase ni ba zakpaha ni. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Kokwokwoshi kpiri kaha lemani ishi oye, aba bwo owe kimu ki ikpiye, aba yo oza ni ikpiye kpo otu kaha ba yimu ni. Anya ko Owuso shu ko yikweyi kaha, byoni oyikweyi kananoho ni.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Iyinyinyi ko Owuso ke sheyi gagye, kweyi imu ni ogbo daha ni nwashika, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />koni agekwu ipu ko ozalabi kaha ni, oyaha gbo olayi kpo Okristi. Bwebe ke eshi ko Owuso pini angmala la. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Owuso yaha nyiso bwikwu kpo Okristi Adole ka, kweyi yaha bagye kpanu iso ipu ko Okristi. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Owuso yo mani ko sayi ke eshi nu ni gbokoka lo ni do oyi kpiri ni yawa ni bwebe ki imu kaha noya ipu ko Okristi Oyesu ni. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Bwebe ke eshi ko Owuso ngmala ikweyi kotuse kala, Omani ke woyoya kala lalo, owe eshi bwebe ko Owuso la. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Aba pye bwebe koko lalo, shini ashishe naka gwakya ikweyi nu lo. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Aha woko kabo ko Owuso la, oyaha ipu ko Okristi Oyesu ko yoko neshi, ni Owuso kwobonu kyanutu daha ko ya.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awoye Kponu Ipu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Ala rela koza ni ala we ishi oye ni, ni wase ko Oyahuda bwebe koma lo ni ase ko Oyahuda ba yala ogwu mo ofu afafu kweyi ba yiyiwa ogwu mo awase ni shofu ni (oni woza ni ase ba ya ikpiye wa ni la). <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Ishi oni ala kema kpo Okristi. Ala wa awogboga kweyi ala bipu kawase ni Owuso shuwa ni lo. Ala gbabo ipu ka awokoyi ni Owuso she dase nu ki Izrayila ni lo, kweyi ala bipu kese mani gbiyitagye lo ala ke gbo Owuso lo. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Nabani ke, ipu ko Okristi Oyesu ala ni bebe lenu kpo Owuso ni abyala webe nu bwebe ko oyi ko Okristi. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Okristi ke byo omene wa daha bwebe ko yase ko Oyahuda kpa awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni woye kponu. Oya agaya ni yuwa ko kweyi yuwa womonyekwotu kiyiwa ni yi kye kpikpiye nu. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Oyo Ono kase ko Oyahuda yi sa kpowe koza yoya wa, shini ona yase ko Oyahuda kpa awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni na woye kponu ipu nu, bwebe koni oyuwa bagye ko omene kpiyiwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Okristi yuwa wo omonyekwotu kiyiwa ke lo bwebe kikwu nu ikweyi ko oshi, bwebe ko oshi okpuwa pwayi ipu kikpiye oye kponu kweyi kwikye awa webe ko Owuso. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Mani oni Okristi wa tono ko Oshu Neshi ko omene dase kpiri, dala ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni lenu kpo Owuso ni, ki dase ko Oyahuda ni lenu kpanu lo ni. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Bwebe ko Okristi pini kpiri kaha, ase ko Oyahuda kpase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, gege ko go obutu ka Ada ipu ko Omaku oye kponu. <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Nabani ala ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni ala wo ogboga ke lo; anani ala woye kponu kpase ko Owuso, kweyi wi ipwoma ko Owuso. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Amala mamani ikweyi kotu koda ni ayikoko ko Oyesu kpa awobane kwu ni, Okristi Oyesu abiyinu pini ke wikyikpo ni shoshi she ni la. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Anu pini byoda kpiri-kpiri la, kweyi yo gye wole ko Owuso sere. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Ipu kema kala kpo Okristi pini amala dudu kpase ashini kpiri ko webe ni Owuso ya yagye anu bwebe ko Omaku nu ni.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Oko ko Obulus Ebe Ka Awase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ikweyi koni pini ami Obulus ni ayun shetu ikweyi ko Okristi Oyesu ela kawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, ya tinarigwu do Owuso. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Kokwokwoshi ala pwo mo Owuso ipu ko neshi nu oda ami oko mani ko ya ikweyi ko oneshi kala. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Owuso sayi koza ni ogbo teba ni dami. Ntenena gbayayi ikweyi nu. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Owoni ala moza ni nta ni, ala ba gye mo ngyoza teba ikweyi ko Okristi. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Nekye-nekye agwi ikweyi nu da ase lo, anani ke Owuso gwi ikweyi nu bwebe ko Omaku sere da ayikoko nu kpa awinobane. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Oza ni ase gye lo oni yoma: bwebe ko oshu neshi ase ni wo Oyahuda lo gbo ogwu kpase ko Oyahuda ipu ka aboneshi ko Owuso; awawigo ki ikpiye oye kponu ki gba abola ipu ko okoyi ni Owuso she bwebe ko Okristi Oyesu ni. <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Ayun woyole ko oshu neshi bwebe ke eshi ko Owuso, ni odami bwebe ko oshu nu ni ya yoko ni. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ami ni ke wo ojije lo ipu kase ko Owuso ni, odami eshi mani ko tono ko odu ko Okristi ni gbomeyi lo ni da ase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />shini na yase kpiri na moza ni Owuso gbo teba ko wa gbodagye ni. Owuso ni yo ojoji kpiri ni yoza mani teba do oyi wonyonya ni shigbo ni, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />shini anani, bwebe kawo ko Owuso, awokpogwu kpa awine ko oshu kole ki iso kpiri na gyo Owuso kpo oziyi nu. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Owuso ya mani byoni ogbo ko ya ome ona yese ni, owa yoza mani ya bwebe ko Okristi Oyesu Adole kaha. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Ipu ko dudu kaha kpo Okristi bwebe ko totuso aha pyoshu ko gobutu ko Owuso kpotu oye kponu. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Nyya bala, ala ka gbo otu ikweyi ko owe ni nyya ma ikweyi kala ni lo, kpiri wa ko oneshi kala la.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ikweyi koni nkwagye obutu ka Ada, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />ni ipwoma wonyonya iso kpe ese pyiye wa bwebe nu ni. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Nyya bo Owuso ipu kodu kigyashi nu mo ona dala oshu bwebe ko Omaku nu ko talotugbagba, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />nkyi ya tinarigwu mo Okristi na yagye ipu ko otu kala bwebe ko otuse. Nyya tinarigwu shala gbogba kpo otu ipu ki imu, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />shini ala, kpase ko Owuso kpiri, ala gboshu ko gyo owa kpenu, ikpo kpo libwu kimu yoya ko Okristi. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Olemani, ko ki gyi imu ko Okristi, koni aba gye kweyi lo ni, shini otu ka ala na lebyo otu ko Owuso.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Anu ni bwebe ko oshu nu ni ya yoko ipu kaha ni ko ya shoza ni aba doka ni, kwoza ni yipu kotu kaha ni: <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />igyashi wa ko Owuso ipu ko oda ko Owuso kpipu ko Okristi Oyesu di ishi kpiri, ko gbogbo-gbogbo! Nalemani.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Ema Ipu ki Ikpiye ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Ni olemani oni, ami ni ayun shetu ikweyi koni nyya yoko ka Adole ni, ya ba ala mala bagye neshi gyogye kpogwu ni Owuso yalo ogwu ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ipu ki ishi kpiri ala ka zikweyi iso lo, ala gbo otumene, ala zotu. Ala sayi kimu yoya kala bwebe ko gbotu kpi iyikala. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Ala takirikwu shala bipu kema kpo Omaku bwebe ko omene ni kpala gbayi ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Ikpiye woye kponu, Omaku woye kponu, byoni otuse woye kponu ni Owuso yalogwu gipu nu ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Adole woye kponu, otuse woye kponu, obatisma woye kponu; <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Owuso woye Ada kase kpiri, ni wa Adole kase kpiri, ni ya yoko kpase kpiri kweyi yipu kase kpiri ni.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Ananoho kaha nyeshi gyogye kpo oza ni Okristi daha ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Byoni Okpa ko Owuso ka ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;&lt;Ishini otoshi gisiso ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">obya awase nwashika ni bo oruduru ni ga kpanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">oda ase eshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Anani, owoni amo &lt;ogiso&gt; ase nu lemoji? Ela mani sayi mo ikyikyo osa weyeye kese. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Mani oni anu ni sa bwiso ni ananu pini toshi giso la, ogiso kweyi gwawiso ta, shini ona yese kpiri na nwonwu kpi iyinu. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Anu pini da ase eshi la; oyase shishini wa ayikoko ko Oyesu, ase shishini wa awinobane, ase shishini wa awotono, ase shishini wa awosapa kpa awofoza. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Oya mani ko kyase ko Owuso kpiri tu ko yoko ka awogboso, shini ikpiye ko Okristi na gye gohobu. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Gbishini kpiri kaha ba woye kponu ipu kotuse kaha kpo ogyogye ko Oyi ko Owuso; aha ba wa zokwu, kweyi ba fi ikpo ko Okristi. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Ebeni aba wa ayi leke kelo, ni awo gyase egya ba kpaha geye giso kpowu ko ozafofu wa ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Abishi koni, ahan ko okwokwoshi ipu ki imu, shini ahan gye ipu ko Okristi, ni wi Ikweyi ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Bwebe nu igo ki ikpiye kpiri gbayi dudu, kweyi oriho yuwa byi. Mani oni ishi ni agbabo wonyonya yoko ni oshu ko ya ni, ikpiye kpiri ya gye kweyi ya miyinu giso ipu ki imu.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olayi Pepe ipu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Mani oni nyya pyala akpaha ipu kiye ka Adole mo, ala ka le bya ase ni gyo Owuso lo ni, awo kpela yeye shotu <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />ni otu wa yebe dibu ni. Agbabo ipu ko olayi ni Owuso ya dase ni lo, ikweyi koni agyojije lo aki ba zakpaha. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Ake gbiweyi lo; aziyiwa doza bibi ko yoya, kweyi agbimu ko shibita lo.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Omani pini woza ni ala fu bwebe ko Okristi ni lalo! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Ngye mo ala pwoshu nu, kweyi afala okwokwoshi ni yipu ko Oyesu ni, koni ala wa awogboso ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Mani oni ala pya showe kala nekye bita, ni yala ba yoza ni ala ya ga ni bwebe kimu kozalabi. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Owotiri shini otu kala kpela kotu kala na wo opepe, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />kweyi ala wase pepe, ni Owuso ya byanu ni kweyi sayi kiyinu ipu ko olayi ni yo tiriri ki gbotu neshi ni.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Ni olemani oni ala sho kame ko koka bita! Ananoho na ko okwokwoshi do oyinanu, ikweyi koni kpiri kaha wigo kikpiye oye kponu la, ni wo Okristi ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Ishini okyanya, ka ya anya kyokye wo na yo shini oyozalabi lo. Ka yeno na gagye tawo ipu ka anya kyokye lo. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Ka di ibiri owe lo. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Ase ni ya wiyi naka wiyi kelo, kweyi na yoko kpa abo nu, shini ona pyoza neshi ni ya tabo ni shona ki tawoleha abo. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Ela bibi naka bose bwo okwunu kala lo, na wela ni ya tase abo ni kin, ko tase otugbagba shana gye, shini oza ni oya ka ni na yase ni ya pwo ni oneshi. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Ala ka yo otu ko Omaku ko Owuso na bya lo; koni Omaku pini wo olobene ni yipu kala ya sayi mala wa ko Owuso ni la, anu yaha kyogwu otu oye kponu me Eno ya wa ba ni Owuso ya wa ngmala ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Ala shanya yoya bita, kpo otu wowu, kpanya kyokye, kpa afo gbogbo, kpe esa sosa, kweyi ka yanya kase lo. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Abishi koni, ala yi iyikala oneshi ki gbotumene kpi iyikala, kweyi ala yepwo labi gbi iyikala, byoni Owuso rigbala bwebe ko Okristi ni.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Yagye Ipu ko Oyoyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Mani oni, byoni ala wayi ko Owuso moshi ni, ala takirikwu shala lema byanu. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Imu na kpogwu ko oyagye kala, byoni Okristi yimu kaha kweyi zolayi nu ikweyi kaha weshi kpehe ni ayi peshi sho Owuso otu ni.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Byoni ala wase ko Owuso ni, ana ka pwela ke eba boba, kwa agbaza, kwafu yoya ipu kala lo. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Mamani ala ka kela kebi kwela ka arugbetu kwela kigiga susu lo. Abishi koni ala shotunehe do Owuso. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Ala gye kamo, ase ni ya beba, kwa agbaza, kwino yafu ya gbabo ipu ko Obula ko Okristi kpo Owuso lo. Koni afu yoya wowe ko geyagye deka la. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Ashishe na ka gyalegya kpela yeye lo; ikweyi kawoza mani pini anya ko Owuso ya wa sa ikweyi kase ni tawa ko geyagye da nu ni la. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Ni olemani oni ala ka rema wa lo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Koni ishi oye ala abiyikala bebe dibu, nabani ala ke wase ka Adole ni, ala bebe yoyu. Mani oni owotiri shini ala bagye byawase ni wa kebe yoyu ni, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />koni oyoyu pini ya medo koza kpiri ni shoshi ni la, kpo yagye neshi, kpo okwokwoshi. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Ala takirikwu shala gyoza ni ya sha Adole otu ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Ala ka gbabo ipu koza bibi ni ase ba ya ipu kebe dibu ni lo. Ala ke yo otuwa tese. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Owo oza ki iweyi ko koza ni ase ba ya teba ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Ishini ayo ojoji ni aba ya ni yi tese, otu wa ya tese kya; <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />koni oyoyu pini yaha ba mojoji kpiri la. Oza ni ya ni ase ba kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">&lt;&lt;Ala nyiso, awogbola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">ala nyiso bwi ikwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">kweyi ola Okristi ya yu ipu kala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Ni olemani oni ala gbera kpo oyagye kala. Ala ka bagye byi ikyo lo, ala ke bagye byase ni ziyi ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Ala yoko neneshi kpi ishi kpiri nala gbo ni, ikweyi koni ishi mani wishi bibi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Ala ka wi ikyo lo, ala ke takirikwu ko gyoza ni Adole ya yimu shala ya ni.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Ala ka gwinyi ya lo, oya yala yishi; abishi koni, ala nwonwu kpo Omaku ko Owuso. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Ala kela diyikala kpa awigye ko Odawuda, kpa awigye ashini, kpa awigye ko omaku; ala wigye kpa awigye ko Odawuda da Adole, ba shaniye ipu kotu kala. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Ipu kiye ka Adole Oyesu Okristi, ala bi shotunehe ikweyi kojoji do Owuso Ada ishi kpiri.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anya Kpa Awoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Ala geyagye diyikala ikweyi koni ala ba mo Okristi gyiyi ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Anya, ala geyagye da awoba kala, byoni ala ba geyagye da Adole ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Koni oba wi ikweyi ko onya nu byoni Okristi wi ikweyi ka awogboso ni; kweyi Okristi abiyinu wo olowoyi ka awogboso, ni wikpiye nu ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Mamani anya na ziyiwa kpiri-kpiri dawobu wa byoni awogboso Okristi ba geyagye danu ni.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Ala awoba, ala yimu ka anya kala byoni Okristi yimu ka awogboso kweyi gekwu ikweyi wa ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Oya mani shini ona yawo awogboso na kpi inyo shini ana wase sere kweyi ona yuwa do Owuso bwebe kela nu, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />shini ona diyinu awogboso sere ni gbepwo lo, ni kyokya lo oke gbinyi kwoje labi lo. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Ni olemani oni awoba na yimu ka anya wa byoni aba yimu ki ikpiye wa ni. Ase ni yimu ko onya nu oyimu kiyinu. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Ashishe ya tela kikpiye nu lo. Abishi koni, ananoho ya di ikpiye nu ozarore kweyi ya kyanutu, byoni Okristi ya ya kpa awogboso ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Koni aha wi igo ki ikpiye nu la. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Byoni Okpa ko Owuso ka ni, &lt;&lt;Ikweyi koni Ongo ya sha ada nu kpi inanu bita kweyi ya wo oye kponu kpo onya nu, kweyi pepa wa ba wi ikpiye oye kponu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Omani wokwokwoshi ni ayi teba ebe lenu ni la, ami ke ya kela ikweyi ko Okristi kpa awogboso la. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Kwikyikyeni, ananoho kala na yimu ko onya nu byoni oyimu ki iyinu ni, kweyi onya na geyagye do obu nu.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Ayi kpa Adawa kpi Inawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Ayi, ala geyagye da ada kala kpe ene kala ipu ka Adole, koni oshoshi ko ya mani. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Ala geyagye da ada kala kpe ene kala omani pini wo ono kikyikyo ni gbo okoyi ni la: <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />&lt;&lt;shini ona shoshi dawo, shini orese.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Ala awada kpe ene, ala ka yotu kayi kala na bya lo, ala ke byuwa neshi kweyi fuwa ko kono ka Adole.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oshe kpa Adole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Awoshe, ala geyagye da awadole kala kese mani, ala yoshi wa, ala kikweyi agye dawa; kweyi ala geyagye dawa kpotu oye kponu, byala ba ya do Okristi oni. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Ala ka ya ko moma kiyi wa kin shini ana kala lo; ala ke yoza ni Owuso ya yimu ni, byoni ala wo oshe ko Okristi ni. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Ala yoko kala ko oshe kpo otunehe, byala ba yoko da Adole la, wa asuse la lo. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Ala gye ma Adole ya da ananoho kaha abola, ko wo oshe ko wo oshe lo, ikweyi koko neshi ni ananoho ya ya ni. <verse eid="EPH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Awadole, ala ya mamani kpa awo oshe kala kweyi ala ka tuwoshi lo. Ala gye mo kala ka awo oshe kala gba Adole oye kponu ipu ki iso, ni ya kepwo ka ananoho gyogye ni.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyo ke Efu ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Ko gwejeji, ala hagye loshu ipu ka Adole kpo oshu nu. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Ala shiyo kefu kpiri ko Owuso, shala kpefu kpi ibiri kpi ipya nu. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Ikweyi koni aba kpefu kpebe ni gboyi ni lalo, aba kpefu kpa awoteyi, kpa awase ni oshu yabo wa ni, kpa awoshu kebe dibu kpa awoshu ko omaku bibi ni bole ki iso ni. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ni olemani oni ala shiyo kefu ko Owuso anani! Shini ishini eno bibi oni wa, ala ba gege ko hagye loshu; kweyi ishini ala yojoji kweyi, ala kyi ba gege ko hagye.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Ala hagye loshu, okwokwoshi na wo ogbogbo ko gbo ogbeyi kala, oneshi na wo oshiye kogye kala, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />kweyi imu ko tono ko Oshu Neshi ko omene na wo okpabawu kikpo kala. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Ipu kishi kpiri ala byo otuse na wo okpawu kala; shala yiyita kibiri ni ya shola ni myi kpanu. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Ala lo ozakeyi kogye ni wolayi ni Owuso dala ni, kpe ewakpa ko Omaku, ni we ela ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Ala tinarigwu ipu ko Omaku ishi kpiri, ala bo Owuso shona talabo. Ala wiyikala shu kweyi ala ka gbo otu lo; ala tinarigwu dase ko Owuso kpiri. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Ala tinarigwu dami mamani, shini Owuso na dami ela ko koka ishi kpiri ni ngwo okwunu ko tono koza teba ko oshu neshi, gboshi yoya lo. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Ikweyi ko ono totu mani pini nwwo oyoleho la, anani ke ayun shetu. Ala tinarigwu dami shini naka yoshi ko tono nu byoni nshu ko tu ni lo.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogbogba ko Gwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Otayikyikwus, oyene kaha moshi ni wo oyole ko kwokwoshi ipu koko ka Adole ni, ya koshu kpiri dala shala gyoza ni ya gbodagye kpami kpoza ni nyya ya ni. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Oza ni ya ni nyya toleho ebe kala ni oma, shala gyoza ni abanu ni kweyi ona tala otugbagba.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Owuso Ada kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi na da awogboso kpiri omene kpi imu kpo otuse. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Nyya beshi ko Owuso na yo kpase kpiri ni ba yimu ka Adole kaha Oyesu Okristi kpi imu ni ya kweyi lo ni.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>